TODO
## Data Flow
TODO
## External Services
TODO
## Deployment Model
TODO
## Architecture Decisions
TODO
EOF

write_file "docs/10_TASK_BREAKDOWN.md" <<'EOF'
# Task Breakdown
## Milestones
TODO
## Tasks
TODO
## Dependencies
TODO
## Risks
TODO
EOF

write_file "docs/15_CHANGELOG.md" <<'EOF'
# Changelog
## Unreleased
- Initialized project structure.
EOF

write_file "docs/16_ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA.md" <<'EOF'
# Acceptance Criteria
## Project-Level Acceptance Criteria
TODO
## Feature-Level Acceptance Criteria
TODO
## Test Expectations
TODO
